  "notes": "USAGE:\nDescribes both physical movement of people in a location and ongoing mutual visits between people. Can be used with ⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ to mean \"to go back and forth\" or \"to visit each other.\"\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{人|ひと}→人：00476_hito⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{行|い}き{来|き}: foot traffic, people coming and going\n- {行|い}き{来|き}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦ある→ある：00006_aru⟧: to have contact/exchanges\n- {行|い}き{来|き}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to come and go, to visit back and forth\n- {行|い}き{来|き}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{激|はげ}しい→激しい：02348_hageshii⟧: heavy traffic (of people)",
